IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa4-approval-loans`

-- coa4-tests-approval-loans.l4: tests for coa4-approval-loans.l4 (ss 197 to 204(2)). Expected values are written from the text of the
-- section named beside each assertion, before the code was run.

